---
import { faqs, site } from '../data/site';
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
---

<section class="section faq" id="faq" style="--h: 1; --hm: 2">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head">
      <h2><span class="eyebrow">常见问题</span>合作前，先把价格、版权与维护说清楚</h2>
      <p class="section-lede">远程协作、素材授权、源码交接与后期维护都在合作前说明，不用靠“到时候再说”。</p>
    </div>

    <div class="faq-layout">
      <div class="faq-list">
        {faqs.map((faq) => (
          <details open>
            <summary>
              <span>{faq.question}</span>
              <i aria-hidden="true"></i>
            </summary>
            <p>{faq.answer}</p>
          </details>
        ))}
      </div>

      <aside class="faq-support" data-ui role="img" aria-label="项目问题通过邮件进入判断、范围与下一步建议的工作流示意">
        <span class="faq-support__label">直接问也可以</span>
        <div class="faq-support__graphic" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="mail-ticket"><Icon name="mail" size={24} /><span>项目问题</span></div>
          <span class="mail-line"><i></i></span>
          <div class="mail-decision">判断<br /><small>是否适合合作</small></div>
          <span class="mail-line"><i></i></span>
          <div class="mail-ticket"><Icon name="check" size={24} /><span>下一步建议</span></div>
        </div>
        <a class="link" href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email} <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
        <p>不需要先写完美的需求文档，先说清楚目标、现状和卡点。</p>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
